# What not to ship in the VSIX.
#
# The bundled GDR runtime and the compiled output are the payload; sources,
# tests, tooling and git noise are not. `resources/gdr` is git-ignored but the
# extension cannot run without it, so it is explicitly re-included below
# (vsce honors .gitignore unless a .vscodeignore negation says otherwise).
# The webview needs `src/webview/style.css`, so `src/` stays in the package.

node_modules/**
test/**
scripts/**
package-lock.json
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.test.json
.gitignore
**/*.map

# The vendored runtime is generated (git-ignored); carry it anyway.
!resources/gdr/**
